MODULE: ChunkBoundedUnboundedChunk
TARGET: ChunkBounded
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: A probe ignores the configured per-callback tree bound.
PERTURBS: ProbeChunk
--- FIND
    /\ LET stop == Min(TreeCount, cursor + ChunkSize)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: probe the entire remainder in one callback.
    /\ LET stop == TreeCount
--- END
